{"id": "3295631", "name": "קיצון מוחלט של פונקציה ריבועית על אליפסה - גרסה מעוצבת", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 2, "functions": [{"name": "xmap", "params": ["U", "V"], "body": "if fam=1 then cx+U\n elseif fam=2 then cx+U-V\n elseif fam=3 then cx+U+V\n elseif fam=4 then cx+U\n elseif fam=5 then cx+2*U-V\n else cx+U-V"}, {"name": "ymap", "params": ["U", "V"], "body": "if fam=1 then cy+V\n elseif fam=2 then cy+V\n elseif fam=3 then cy+V\n elseif fam=4 then cy+V-U\n elseif fam=5 then cy+V-U\n else cy+2*V-U"}], "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width: 920px; margin: auto; line-height: 1.65; text-align: right; color: #1f2937;\">\n<div style=\"background: #F4F1F5; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 14px; padding: 18px; margin-bottom: 14px;\"><strong style=\"color: #4b1f6f; font-size: 20px;\">קיצון מוחלט של פונקציה ריבועית בתחום סגור</strong>\n<p>נתונה הפונקציה</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; background: white; border-radius: 9px; padding: 11px; font-size: 19px;\">\\(\\displaystyle f(x,y)={{CT:0}}\\)</div>\n<p>בתחום הסגור המוגדר על ידי</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; background: white; border-radius: 9px; padding: 11px; font-size: 18px;\">\\(\\displaystyle {{CT:1}}\\le {{CT:2}}\\)</div>\n<p>מצאו את נקודות המקסימום והמינימום המוחלטים ואת ערכי הפונקציה בהן.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 15px; margin-bottom: 12px; background: white;\"><strong style=\"color: #4b1f6f;\">א. הנקודה הקריטית</strong>\n<p>לפונקציה נקודה קריטית יחידה. קבעו את מיקומה ביחס לתחום.</p>\n<div style=\"text-align: center; background: #FAF9FB; padding: 10px; border-radius: 9px;\">[[input:location]]\n<div style=\"display: none;\">[[validation:location]]</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit,minmax(300px,1fr)); gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px;\">\n<div style=\"border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 15px; background: white;\"><strong style=\"color: #4b1f6f;\">ב. נקודת המינימום</strong>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; background: #FAF9FB; padding: 11px; border-radius: 9px; margin-top: 9px;\">\\(x_{min}=\\) [[input:ans1]]    \\(y_{min}=\\) [[input:ans2]] <br>[[validation:ans1]] [[validation:ans2]]</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 15px; background: white;\"><strong style=\"color: #4b1f6f;\">ג. נקודת המקסימום</strong>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; background: #FAF9FB; padding: 11px; border-radius: 9px; margin-top: 9px;\">\\(x_{max}=\\) [[input:ans3]]    \\(y_{max}=\\) [[input:ans4]] <br>[[validation:ans3]] [[validation:ans4]]</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 15px; background: white;\"><strong style=\"color: #4b1f6f;\">ד. ערכי הקיצון</strong>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; background: #FAF9FB; padding: 12px; border-radius: 9px; margin-top: 9px;\">\\(\\min f=\\) [[input:ans5]]     \\(\\max f=\\) [[input:ans6]] <br>[[validation:ans5]] [[validation:ans6]]</div>\n</div>\n</div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width: 980px; margin: auto; text-align: right; line-height: 1.72; color: #1f2937;\">\n<div style=\"background: #F4F1F5; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px; margin-bottom: 12px;\"><strong style=\"color: #4b1f6f; font-size: 18px;\">1. הנקודה הקריטית</strong>\n<p>מחשבים את הנגזרות החלקיות ופותרים את המערכת \\(f_x=f_y=0\\).</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; background: white; padding: 10px; border-radius: 9px;\">\\(\\displaystyle f_x={{CT:3}}, \\qquad f_y={{CT:4}} \\)</div>\n<p>הפתרון היחיד הוא</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; background: white; padding: 10px; border-radius: 9px;\">\\(\\displaystyle P_c={{CT:5}}\\)</div>\n<p>בודקים אם הנקודה נמצאת בתוך התחום, על שפתו או מחוצה לו. רק נקודה שבתוך התחום מועמדת לקיצון פנימי.</p></div>\n<div style=\"background: white; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px; margin-bottom: 12px;\"><strong style=\"color: #4b1f6f; font-size: 18px;\">2. בדיקת השפה</strong>\n<p>על השפה אפשר להשתמש בכופלי לגראנז' עבור</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; background: #FAF9FB; padding: 10px; border-radius: 9px;\">\\(\\displaystyle f_x=\\lambda h_x, \\qquad f_y=\\lambda h_y, \\qquad h(x,y)={{CT:6}}=0 \\)</div>\n<p>כאשר</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; background: #FAF9FB; padding: 10px; border-radius: 9px;\">\\(\\displaystyle h_x={{CT:7}}, \\qquad h_y={{CT:8}} \\)</div>\n<p>המבנה של השאלה מאפשר לראות את החישוב בצורה נקייה במיוחד אם מגדירים</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; background: #F4F1F5; padding: 10px; border-radius: 9px;\">\\(\\displaystyle u={{CT:9}}, \\qquad v={{CT:10}} \\)</div>\n<p>ואז התחום הוא הדיסקה \\(u^2+v^2\\le {{CT:2}}\\), והפונקציה היא</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; background: #F4F1F5; padding: 10px; border-radius: 9px;\">\\(\\displaystyle f={{CT:11}}\\Bigl((u-{{CT:12}})^2+(v-{{CT:13}})^2\\Bigr)+{{CT:14}} \\)</div>\n<p>לכן צריך להשוות את הנקודה בתחום הקרובה ביותר ל־\\(({{CT:12}},{{CT:13}})\\) ואת הנקודה הרחוקה ביותר ממנה.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: white; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px;\"><strong style=\"color: #4b1f6f; font-size: 18px;\">3. התוצאה</strong>\n<div style=\"overflow-x: auto;\">\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; margin: 10px auto; min-width: 560px; text-align: center;\">\n<thead>\n<tr style=\"background: #F4F1F5; color: #4b1f6f;\">\n<th style=\"border: 1px solid #DED7E1; padding: 8px 12px;\">סוג</th>\n<th style=\"border: 1px solid #DED7E1; padding: 8px 12px;\">נקודה</th>\n<th style=\"border: 1px solid #DED7E1; padding: 8px 12px;\">ערך</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid #DED7E1; padding: 8px 12px;\">מינימום מוחלט</td>\n<td dir=\"ltr\" style=\"border: 1px solid #DED7E1; padding: 8px 12px;\">\\({{CT:15}}\\)</td>\n<td dir=\"ltr\" style=\"border: 1px solid #DED7E1; padding: 8px 12px;\">\\({{CT:16}}\\)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid #DED7E1; padding: 8px 12px;\">מקסימום מוחלט</td>\n<td dir=\"ltr\" style=\"border: 1px solid #DED7E1; padding: 8px 12px;\">\\({{CT:17}}\\)</td>\n<td dir=\"ltr\" style=\"border: 1px solid #DED7E1; padding: 8px 12px;\">\\({{CT:18}}\\)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:ploc]] [[feedback:ppoints]] [[feedback:pvalues]] [[feedback:porder]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "", "prtpartiallycorrect": "", "prtincorrect": "", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 5, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans2", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 5, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans3", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 5, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans4", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 5, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans5", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 6, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans6", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 6, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "location", "type": "dropdown", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 0, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": "nonotanswered "}], "prts": [{"name": "ploc", "value": 0.1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "location", "tans": "loccode", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "ploc-1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">מיקום הנקודה הקריטית נכון.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "ploc-1-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">בדקו שוב את מיקום הנקודה הקריטית ביחס לתחום.</div>"}}]}, {"name": "porder", "value": 0.1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "bad:if is(ans5>ans6)=true then 1 else 0;ord:1-bad;", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ord", "tans": "1", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "porder-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "porder-1-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"background: #FFF4E5; border: 1px solid #F3C778; border-radius: 9px; padding: 10px; font-weight: bold; color: #8a4b08;\">ערך המינימום שהזנתם גדול מערך המקסימום! זה לא הגיוני!</div>"}}]}, {"name": "ppoints", "value": 0.4, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "a1:if is(equal(radcan(ans1-tans1),0)) then 1 else 0;a2:if is(equal(radcan(ans2-tans2),0)) then 1 else 0;a3:if is(equal(radcan(ans3-tans3),0)) then 1 else 0;a4:if is(equal(radcan(ans4-tans4),0)) then 1 else 0;ps:(a1+a2+a3+a4)/4;", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "1", "tans": "1", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": "ps", "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "ppoints-1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">קואורדינטות נכונות: <strong>{@a1+a2+a3+a4@}</strong> מתוך 4.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "ppoints-1-F", "feedback": ""}}]}, {"name": "pvalues", "value": 0.4, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "v1:if is(equal(radcan(ans5-tans5),0)) then 1 else 0;v2:if is(equal(radcan(ans6-tans6),0)) then 1 else 0;vs:(v1+v2)/2;", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "1", "tans": "1", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": "vs", "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "pvalues-1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">ערכי קיצון נכונים: <strong>{@v1+v2@}</strong> מתוך 2.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "pvalues-1-F", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["Pc", "Ph", "Pl", "Pmax", "Pmin", "R", "Uf", "Ul", "Un", "bdry", "bx", "by", "cx", "cy", "dh", "dir", "dl", "ellipse", "ex", "ey", "fam", "func", "fx", "fy", "h", "k", "loc_op", "loccode", "maxVal", "minVal", "q", "rel", "rho", "sig", "tans1", "tans2", "tans3", "tans4", "tans5", "tans6", "u", "v", "vh", "vl"], "nvariants": 50}